   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Declension: three patterns",
     "texto": [
      "With the definite article the adjective usually takes the weak ending (**der bekannte Maler**, **mit dem bekannten Maler**). With **ein/kein/possessive**, it uses the mixed ending: if the article does not mark gender or case, the adjective takes a strong ending (**ein bekannter Maler**, **ein bekanntes Bild**). Without an article, the adjective marks gender, case and number (**bekannter Wein**, **mit bekanntem Wein**). Learn the full forms in the table: it is not enough to choose between -e and -en."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
